    "title": "Marvel Rivals Season 7 Details and Patch Notes - Marvel Rivals Guide - IGN",
    "text": "advertisementSeason 7 of Marvel Rivals has arrived, bringing with it White Fox as the newest Hero, new in-game systems and mini-games, a new event, balance updates, fixes, and more! This page acts as a comprehensive breakdown of Season 7 of Marvel Rivals, including a link to the full Patch Notes.New HeroWhite Fox is the latest Hero to be added to the game, and enters as a Strategist. New StoriesThe following stories have been added to the game: New Serial - The Hunt is OnNew White Fox Lore - Shards of HopeNew Captain America Lore - Real PowerNew SystemsAll-New Album SystemCapture Marvel Moments: Save every epic moment, wild dances, and heroic gatherings with the new Album system.Share & Show Off: Instantly share your snapshots with friends and the community.New Mini-Game: Basketball ChallengeGo to Times Square or the Practice Range to attempt the new Shot Challenge, trying your best to top the leaderboards! New In-Store ItemsThe following items have been added to the in-game store: White Fox - Yoon Ji-Woo: The Leader BundleUltron - Odinforce Ultron BundleThe Punisher - Marauder Marksman BundleWhite Fox - Rosy ReconWhite Fox - Emoji BundleS7 Battle PassA brand new Battle Pass will be available, complete with 10 brand new costumes and various cosmetics to unlock! New Event: Dual Life of Peter ParkerComplete missions during this event to earn the Deadpool - Wade Wilson: The Spirit Guard costume for free! CompetitiveNew Placement Match System: Every placement match now tracks your individual performance (not tied to teammates). After ten placement matches, your rank will be adjusted between -100 and +100 competitive points based on your personal results and tier.Ban Phase Updates: Both teams can now ban 3 heroes each (up from 2). To keep the action moving, each ban round has been shortened to 15 seconds (was 20s).Map Pool Returns: Tokyo 2099: Shin-Shibuya is back in the Competitive Mode rotation!Gold Rank Rewards: Reach Gold or above for the exclusive White Fox - Secret Agent costume.College PerksCollege Perk costumes are changing to the following: Magik - PunkchildDoctor Strange - Sorcerer ImmortalLoki - Shin Sagi-ShiInvisible Woman - Future FoundationThe Thing - Future FoundationMoon Knight - Phoenix KnightCaptain America - Captain KlyntarMantis - Jade MaidenThe Punisher - Daredevil: Born AgainIron Fist - Binary FistFixes and OptimizationsCPU Rendering Optimization (PC Only)Rivals with mid-to-high-end CPUs, assemble! Head to Settings > Other > Performance Optimization (Beta) to activate this experimental power-up. Enable it to enjoy a potential boost in performance and smoother battles. Note: This is an experimental feature.Maps and ModesConvoy Mode Score Display: Fixed a bug where the scoreboard could display incorrectly if the match ended while a mission vehicle was nearing its destination.HeroesAngela's Divine Double-Tap, No More Early Cooldowns: When Angela descended with Divine Judgement and swiftly followed up with the second strike of Heaven's Retribution, her Wingblade Ascent could prematurely enter cooldown.Venom's Frenzy, Double Trouble No More: At lower frame rates, using Cellular Corrosion during Frenzied Arrival could sometimes trigger both abilities at the same time, twice the symbiote, twice the chaos!Cloak & Dagger's Shadow Survival, No More Ghosting Out of Death: After using Dark Teleportation to slip into Phased state, Cloak sometimes refused to kick the bucket even at zero Health.Captain America's Updated Combat MechanicCaptain America's normal attack (Sentinel Strike) chain consists of a 6-hit combo. Hits 1 and 2 remain completely unchanged in this update. However, the remaining 4 hits, his ranged shield tosses, have received updates as follows: The Old Mechanics (Pre-Patch): Previously, during the 3rd hit, if you entered a sprint immediately after the shield projectile spawned, it would animation-cancel the rest of the throw, allowing you to instantly trigger the 4th hit. However, if you sprint-canceled before the 3rd hit actually struck the enemy, you would lose the third hit's damage because the shield was immediately recalled. (This same issue plagued hits 5 and 6).The New Mechanics (Current Patch): Hits 3, 4, 5, and 6 no longer cancel each other out with sprinting. You can now throw the shield while sprinting, ensuring both Super-Soldier mobility and consistent damage output.Additional Balance AdjustmentsCaptain America Increase the Damage dealt by the first two hits of Sentinel Strike and melee attacks from 40 to 45.Emma Frost Reduce Diamond Form cooldown from 18s to 15s.Increase Mind's Aegis recovery rate from 70/s to 80/s.Black Panther Spinning Kick New Effect: The dash movement is now omnidirectional. T'Challa is no longer bound to a flat plane.Increase Spinning Kick Damage from 70 to 75.Reduce Spear Toss recovery time per charge from 6s to 5s.Gambit Reduce Ragin' Royal Flush (Ultimate Ability) effect duration from 10s to 8s.Full Patch NotesIf you wish to read the Patch Notes in full, you can do so via the official Marvel Rivals websites Season 7 Patch Notes post. Was this guide helpful?In This Guide",
